      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WOKKA ROCK (10) went back last start then worked home in impressive style to score by 7 metres at this track over 1660m, a well-deserved victory following his good third two runs ago. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. That latest effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. MULLUM GUIDO (7) was struggling to make his mark before the latest appearance when he scored by 3 metres over 1660m at this track. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row. Tackles a similar assignment and he can go right on with the job. JASPERSTIMETOSHINE (3) finished fifth first-up last time out when he broke in a 1660m event at this track a week ago. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Only needs to get things right to be in the money. WATCH ME RAIDER (9) is in the mix after turning in a better effort last start to finish third at Bathurst over 1730m.",
